ShallowFrontier
=============

ShallowFrontier investigates reducing candidate-scoring overhead
in differential-entropy-based LLM training-data selection.

Upstream research and software
------------------------------

InstructDiff: Domain-Adaptive Data Selection via Differential Entropy
for Efficient LLM Fine-Tuning

Official upstream repository:
https://github.com/zhuchichi56/Instruct-diff

The InstructDiff authors retain attribution and any applicable
rights in their original code and research contributions.

ShallowFrontier contributions
-----------------------------

Project-specific contributions include prefix-limited scoring,
asymmetric entropy extrapolation, K128/K256 experiments,
selection-stage cost analysis, GPU energy analysis, and
associated reproducibility tooling.

